 Welcome to LinuxOnTab 2.0 (wasm32)

 Kernel:  Linux 6.1.0-linuxontab (WebAssembly, no x86 emulation)
 Arch:    wasm32 · Userland: BusyBox + musl libc
 Docs:    https://linuxontab.com/
 Bugs:    https://github.com/kilian-ai/linuxontab/issues

 ── Now working (all compiled to wasm32, running natively) ──────────────
   Terminal   tmux (splits/panes) · mc (F10 to quit) · nano · lotfm
   Monitor    htop — live meters + process table of THIS wasm kernel
   Shells     zsh 5.9  NEW! · ash · hush (default /bin/sh)
              real fork()+setjmp/longjmp via wasm-EH — command
              substitution, subshells & job control all work
   Languages  python3 + pip · node · clang (self-hosting toolchain)
   Tools      curl · jq · sqlite3 · wasm-ld · wasm-opt
   Media      ffmpeg · ffprobe 7.0 — demux/remux/decode any format (try: ffmpeg -i /root/clips/dvd.mpg -f null -)
   Spiel      spiel-demo — the Spiel media server (FastAPI + React) on :8080 → top bar: web view
   Web        nginx-demo — real nginx 1.26 serving a demo site on :8080
              httpd-demo — Apache httpd 2.4 (prefork) on :8081 → top bar: web view
   DB GUI     sqlite-web -p 8080 /root/demo.db   → top bar: web view
   Games      tetris — color Tetris (vitetris) · vnc-snake on the X display
   X11        xtiny &     a real X server + desktop on :5900. Then open
                          the X display panel (top bar) and hit connect.
              Launch apps from its taskbar, or by hand:
                DISPLAY=:1 xterm -fn fixed -e /bin/sh </dev/null &
                DISPLAY=:1 xeyes </dev/null &
              Keep the </dev/null — an X client left on the console
              busy-reads it and pegs the CPU.
   VNC demos  vnc-server  eyes whose pupils track your mouse
              vnc-snake   snake game — arrows/WASD steer, p pause, r restart
              run these INSTEAD of xtiny — all three share port 5900
   AI         claw   (LLM REPL — export ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, then: claw)

   Tip: TERM is xterm-256color, so mc/nano/tmux come up in full color.

